<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Micro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Monday it had started coverage of Advanced Micro Devices Inc with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Analyst John Marren was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The microprocessor company's shares closed at 27-5/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
